    text: "Affected stops:\r\nRock Creek Pkwy & Coalton Rd (#25041) (northbound)\r\nRock Creek Pkwy & Honey Creek Ln (#25042) (northbound)\r\nRock Creek Pkwy & S 88th St (#25043) (northbound)\r\nRock Creek Pkwy & Indiana St (#25044) (northbound)\r\nRock Creek Pkwy & Pitkin St (#25045) (northbound)\r\nRock Creek Pkwy & McCaslin Blvd (#25079) (northbound)\r\nRock Creek Pkwy & McCaslin Blvd (#25537) (southbound)\r\nRock Creek Pkwy & Pitkin Ave (#25067) (southbound)\r\nRock Creek Pkwy & Indiana St (#25068) (southbound)\r\nRock Creek Pkwy & S 88th St (#25069) (southbound)\r\nRock Creek Pkwy & Coalridge Dr (#25070) (southbound)\r\nRock Creek Pkwy & Coalton Rd (#25071) (southbound)\r\n\nFor northbound Route 228F get on/off buses at:\r\nCoalton Rd & S Tyler Dr (#25040)\r\nMain St & Gateway Dr (#35529)\r\n\nFor southbound Route 228F get on/off buses at:\r\nMain St & Gateway Dr (#35406)\r\nCoalton Rd & Rock Creek Pkwy (#34133)"
